tat\tacquisition\tof\tthe\tsecurity.\tIn addition,\tcertain\tother\tsecurities\twere\treclassified\tto\tAFS\tinvestments\tin\tresponse to\n\nsignificant\tcredit\tdeterioration.\tBecause\tthe\tCompany\tgenerally\tintends\tto\tsell these\treclassified\tsecurities,\tCiti\trecorded\tOTTI\ton\tthe\tsecurities.\tThe\tfollowing table\tsets\tforth,\tfor\tthe\tperiods\tindicated,\tthe\tcarrying\tvalue\tof\tHTM\tsecurities\tsold and\treclassified\tto\tAFS,\tas\twell\tas\tthe\trelated\tgain\t(loss)\tor\tthe\tOTTI\tlosses recorded\ton\tthese\tsecurities.\n\n# Securities\tAvailable-for-Sale\n\nThe\tamortized\tcost\tand\tfair\tvalue\tof\tAFS\tsecurities\tat\tDecember\t31\twere\tas\tfollows:\n\n| In\tmillions\tof\tdollars | Amortized<br>cost | Gross<br>unrealized<br>gains | Gross<br>unrealized<br>losses | Fair<br>value | Amortized<br>cost | Gross<br>unrealized<br>gains | Gross<br>unrealized<br>losses | Fair<br>value |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Debt\\tsecurities\\tAFS |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Mortgage-backed\\tsecurities(1) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| U.S.\\tgovernment-sponsored\\tagency\\tguaranteed | $39,584 | $367 | $237 | $39,714 | $35,647 | $603 | $159 | $36,091 |\n| Prime | 2 | — | — | 2 | 12 | — | — | 12 |\n| Alt-A | 50 | 5 | — | 55 | 43 | 1 | — | 44 |\n| Non-U.S.\\tresidential | 5,909 | 31 | 11 | 5,929 | 8,247 | 67 | 7 | 8,307 |\n| Commercial | 573 | 2 | 4 | 571 | 551 | 6 | 3 | 554 |\n| Total\\tmortgage-backed\\tsecurities | $46,118 | $405 | $252 | $46,271 | $44,500 | $677 | $169 | $45,008 |\n| U.S.\\tTreasury\\tand\\tfederal\\tagency\\tsecurities |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| U.S.\\tTreasury | $113,096 | $254 | $515 | $112,835 | $110,492 | $353 | $127 | $110,718 |\n| Agency\\tobligations | 10,095 | 22 | 37 | 10,080 | 12,925 | 60 | 13 | 12,972 |\n| Total\\tU.S.\\tTreasury\\tand\\tfederal\\tagency\\tsecurities | $123,191 | $276 | $552 | $122,915 | $123,417 | $413 | $140 | $123,690 |\n| State\\tand\\tmunicipal(2) | $12,099 | $132