| Total\\timpairment\\tlosses\\trecognized\\tin\\tearnings | $393 | $31 | $— | $424 |\n\n| OTTI\ton\tInvestments\tand\tOther\tAssets |  | Year\tended<br>December\t31,\t2013 | Year\tended<br>December\t31,\t2013 |  |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| In\\tmillions\\tof\\tdollars | AFS(1) | HTM | Other\\nassets(2) | Total |\n| Impairment\\tlosses\\trelated\\tto\\tsecurities\\tthat\\tthe\\tCompany\\tdoes\\tnot\\tintend\\tto\\tsell\\tnor\\twill\\tlikely\\tbe\\trequired\\tto\\tsell: |  |  |  |  |\n| Total\\tOTTI\\tlosses\\trecognized\\tduring\\tthe\\tperiod | $9 | $154 | $— | $163 |\n| Less:\\tportion\\tof\\timpairment\\tloss\\trecognized\\tin\\tAOCI\\t(before\\ttaxes) | — | 98 | — | 98 |\n| Net\\timpairment\\tlosses\\trecognized\\tin\\tearnings\\tfor\\tsecurities\\tthat\\tthe\\tCompany\\tdoes\\tnot\\tintend\\tto\\tsell\\tnor\\twill\\tlikely\\tbe\\nrequired\\tto\\tsell | $9 | $56 | $— | $65 |\n| Impairment\\tlosses\\trecognized\\tin\\tearnings\\tfor\\tsecurities\\tthat\\tthe\\tCompany\\tintends\\tto\\tsell\\tor\\tmore-likely-than-not\\twill\\nbe\\trequired\\tto\\tsell\\tbefore\\trecovery\\t(2) | 269 | — | 201 | 470 |\n| Total\\timpairment\\tlosses\\trecognized\\tin\\tearnings | $278 | $56 | $201 | $535 |\n\n(2) The\timpairment\tcharge\trelates\tto\tthe\tcarrying\tvalue\tof\tCiti's\tthen-remaining 35%\tinterest\tin\tthe\tMSSB\tjoint\tventure,\toffset\tby\tthe\tequity\tpickup\tfrom\tMSSB\tduring\tthe\trespective\tperiods\tthat\twas recorded\tin\tOther\trevenue.\n\nThe\tfollowing\tare\t12-month\trollforwards\tof\tthe\tcredit-related\timpairments\trecognized\tin\tearnings\tfor\tAFS\tand\tHTM\tdebt\tsecurities\theld\tthat\tthe\tCompany\tdoes\tnot\tintend\tto sell\tnor\tlikely\twill\tbe\trequired\tto\tsell:\n\n# Cumulative\tOTTI\tcredit\tlosses\trecognized\tin\tearnings\ton\tsecurities\tstill\theld\n\n|  |  | Cumulative\tOTTI\tcredit\tlosses\trecognized\tin\tearnings\ton\tsecurities\tstill\theld | Cumulative\tOTTI\tcredit\tlosses\trecognized\tin\tearnings\ton\tsecurities